---
// Site hero.
---

  <section class="relative min-h-screen flex flex-col overflow-hidden hero-c3">
    <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 50% at 22% 45%, rgba(244,98,31,0.10) 0%, transparent 62%)"></div>

    <div class="relative z-10 flex-1 flex items-center w-full max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-12 pt-36 pb-16">
      <div class="md:max-w-[58%]">
        <h1 class="font-light" style="font-family:var(--font-display);color:#fff;font-size:clamp(2.4rem,5.6vw,4.8rem);line-height:1.03;letter-spacing:-0.025em">
          What drives human decisions<span style="color:#F4621F">.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-9 font-light" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.62);font-size:clamp(1rem,1.4vw,1.15rem);line-height:1.65;max-width:52ch;text-wrap:pretty">
          Most of us are never shown how our own minds work. We spend years working against ourselves without knowing it.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-9">
          <a href="#contact" class="inline-block text-sm font-bold tracking-wide pb-2"
            style="font-family:var(--font-display);color:#fff;border-bottom:2px solid #F4621F">Let's work together &nbsp;&rarr;</a>
          <button onclick="openIntroVideo()" class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm font-medium" style="font-family: var(--font-display); color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55); background:none; border:none; cursor:pointer; padding:0">
            <span style="width:32px;height:32px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.07);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);border-radius:50%;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0">
              <svg width="9" height="9" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#fff"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg>
            </span>
            Watch a 55-second intro
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative z-10 w-full border-t" style="border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.08)">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-12 py-7 flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-4">
        <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.28em] uppercase" style="font-family:var(--font-display);color:#F4621F">New York</p>
        <p class="text-xs tracking-[0.14em] uppercase" style="font-family:var(--font-display);color:rgba(255,255,255,0.38)">Finance &nbsp;·&nbsp; Artificial Intelligence &nbsp;·&nbsp; Education</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
